  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Remove local VERSIONING.md in favour of governance reference by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4687\r\n* Docs: Migrate internal links to relref and fix spelling errors by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4700\r\n* Docs: Clarify the use of --reconcile-timeout in getting-started guide by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4689\r\n* Docs: Enforce documentation style guide with spelling check and style fixes by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4690\r\n* Add needs step to save PR num by @efiacor in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4699\r\n* feat: Add CEL-based conditional function execution (#4388) by @SurbhiAgarwal1 in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4469\r\n* Add sonar fix and debug logging by @efiacor in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4706\r\n* Remove internal dir from sonar reporting by @efiacor in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4712\r\n* Docs: use Docsy alert shortcode for notes and warnings by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4703\r\n* Refactor: Move setup-go-kpt composite action from porch to kpt by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4709\r\n* fix: Improve CEL conditional execution consistency and test coverage by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4713\r\n* Docs: Rationalize and document local-config annotation in the book by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4679\r\n* Bump API dependency for v1.0.0 by @mozesl-nokia in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4718\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/compare/v1.0.0-beta.68...v1.0.0",
